<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #1C1678; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .header h2 { color: #1C1678; margin: 0; }
        .details-box { background-color: #f5f6fa; border-left: 4px solid #1C1678; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; padding-top: 15px; font-size: 13px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Enrollment Confirmed!</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Dear <%= user.name %>,</p>
        <p>Greetings from Kairaa Blockchain Academy!</p>
        <p>We are pleased to inform you that your payment has been successfully verified and your enrollment is now confirmed.</p>
        
        <div class="details-box">
            <strong>📚 Course Details:</strong><br/>
            Course Name: <%= course.name %><br/>
            Amount Paid: ₹<%= course.price %>
        </div>
        
        <div class="details-box">
            <strong>💳 Payment Details:</strong><br/>
            Payment Method: UPI (QR Code)<br/>
            Transaction ID (UTR): <%= utr %>
        </div>
        
        <p>Your access to the course has been activated. You can now log in to your account and start learning.</p>
        <p>We truly appreciate your trust in Kairaa Blockchain Academy and wish you great success in your learning journey.</p>
        
        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact us.</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br/>
            <strong>Kairaa Blockchain Academy</strong><br/>
            <a href="mailto:support@kairaaacademy.com">support@kairaaacademy.com</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
